How to Run the Application
1. Save the code in a file named main.py.
2. Install FastAPI and Uvicorn:
pip install fastapi uvicorn
3. Run the application:
uvicorn main:app --reload
4. Open the Swagger API documentation:
http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

Example POST Request
{
"patient_id": 101,
"name": "Rahul Kumar",
"age": 35,

"disease": "Diabetes",
"phone": "9876543210"
}

API Endpoints
Method Endpoint Purpose
GET / Home API
POST /patients Add a patient
GET /patients Get all patients
GET /patients/{patient_id} Get one patient
PUT /patients/{patient_id} Update patient
DELETE /patients/{patient_id} Delete patient

Concepts Demonstrated
FastAPI, Pydantic models, CRUD operations, GET/POST/PUT/DELETE methods, path
parameters, data validation, HTTPException, and Swagger documentation.
